  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up on the mean streets of the Bullies Block ain't for the faint of heart. Scrapper Jack learned early that survival meant knowing how to handle a wing wrecker and always staying one step ahead of the Drip bandits. Now, he uses his street smarts to scout out the best raiding locations and protect his flock's precious DRIP.",
