    "personality": "Streetwise and gritty, Scrapper Jack is always on the lookout for the next big opportunity. He has a slight attitude problem, especially with authority figures, but he's fiercely loyal to his flock. He's also surprisingly sentimental about his old baseball bat, which he calls 'The Negotiator'.",
